Content area from OpenRune/OpenRune-Server#353 (answers there: all of it, one PR per row, ids renumbered against main, wiki data is fine).

From our per-feature patches `15-implings`, `20-bird-houses`, `35-hunter-traps`, `39-herbiboar`, `40-hunter-rumours`, `41-butterfly-netting`, `42-hunter-guild-dialogues` (in [`openrune/upstream/`](https://github.com/AlexPerrin/osrs-plugins-reverse/tree/main/openrune/upstream) of osrs-plugins-reverse), on `main` (`c2492318d`).

**Problem.** OpenRune had no Hunter content.

**Change.** New modules `content/skills/hunter` + pack, in seven commits, one per patch, each on the one before (they could be split into stacked PRs if you prefer):
- **Implings (15):** catching in Puro-Puro and Gielinor with a net (or barehanded at +10 levels) and a jar, jar loot, crystal implings in Prifddinas.
- **Bird houses (20):** the four Fossil Island spaces on varps 1626-1629 (what Time Tracking reads): build, seed, Empty/Reset, nests, the Loot Tracker collect message; `::birdhouses`.
- **Traps (35):** bird snares and box traps (5 birds, ferret, 3 chinchompas) with the trap locs RuneLite's Hunter plugin tracks.
- **Herbiboar (39):** tracking on the client's own trail varbits (RuneLite's Herbiboar plugin reads them): start locs, clue inspects, tunnel, harvest.
- **Hunters' Rumours (40):** state, rare-part drops with rates and pity, turn-in XP and loot sack, the quetzal whistle's Rumour op; `::rumour`.
- **Butterflies (41):** butterfly and moth netting, jars and Release effects, their rumours.
- **Guild dialogues (42):** the guild hunters and Guild Scribe Verity (assign, remind, switch, hand in, unlock, completed count, back-to-back toggle), Gilman's food and drink, embertailed jerboas.

Server-only ids, numbered after the ids already on main and not shared with any of our other PRs, so they merge in any order: dbtables 56002-56012 (rows 60152-60293), varps 63762-63783, timer `hunter_traps` 436.

**Tests.** Hunter integration suites: `ImplingScriptTest`, `ImplingLootScriptTest`, `CrystalImplingScriptTest`, `BirdHouseScriptTest`, `HunterTrapScriptTest`, `HerbiboarScriptTest`, `HunterRumoursTest`, `ButterflyScriptTest`, `HunterGuildScriptTest`. Manual, on our own server build: crystal impling catch and bird houses (Build, Seeds, Empty, the Loot Tracker message) on a client.

On this branch (Docker `eclipse-temurin:21`, upstream's `./gradlew`, 4 GB container; a clean `freshCache` of main restored first, then `:or-cache:buildCache :or-cache:mergePluginGamevals`, then each task as a separate run, then `run` to "Server ready"): RESULTS_PENDING. `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check` finds no conflicts on this branch, nor with all of our open content PRs merged together.

Nothing was checked in game from this exact branch; the in-game checks above were on our own server build (an older main plus these and our other patches).

**Data sources.** Trap and trail locs, varbits and multilocs from the cache; the Herbiboar network from the map's footprints and RuneLite's Herbiboar plugin lists (BSD). OSRS Wiki (by the wiki's contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/): impling jar loot tables, bird house nest chances, the crimson swift catch curve, Hunters' Rumours rare-part rates and pity, butterfly netting success charts, the herbiboar herb chart, and the guild hunter / Verity dialogue transcripts.

**Caveats.**
- Best guesses: catch curves beyond the crimson swift, the 200-tick trap collapse, most trap messages, Herbiboar route lengths, several rumour and part wordings, the barehanded butterfly animation and respawn.
- Not done: lucky impling clue loot, smoking/baiting, the Eagles' Peak requirement, the Herbiboar new-track warning, pet and herb tuft, spare-gear trade, loot sacks opening.

**Release note.** Hunter: implings, bird houses, bird snares and box traps, Herbiboar, butterfly netting and Hunters' Rumours.

